Change-ID: CL-20260803-113
Commit: pending
Date: 2026-08-03
Type: Feature -- protect the last verified revision, and order the gates
Request-or-TODO: The refinement analysis, 2026-08-03, items 1 to 3
Outcome: Three changes, in the order asked for.
  A run now keeps a copy of the worktree at every point where it compiled,
  passed its tests, and matched its acceptance examples, and puts that copy
  back if the loop ends on a state that fails. Every attempt edits the same
  worktree in place, so a run that reached a good state and was sent back for
