  documentation, rather than as one item of four in a combined list.
  The full order a failure is now handled in is cancellation, provider,
  compilation, tests, acceptance, adversarial correctness, coverage,
  documentation. Adversarial review moved ahead of the coverage and
  documentation asks, which is where it belongs: a demonstrated defect is not
  a peer of a missing doc comment.
