  the coordinator's credential reaching a produced program, a go test binary, or
  repository test code, because the environment is stripped before the child
  starts. It does not stop that process opening a socket or writing to an
  absolute path outside the worktree; nothing in this codebase confines a
  running process's syscalls, and the word sandbox appears nowhere
